VibeOS's translations

Many of the translations in VibeOS's po/LANG.po files are those of the Android Open Source Project and LineageOS:
each one carries a translator comment "android: <app> <resource name>" naming the Android app and the string it is
that app's translation of, from the lineage-24.0 sources at the commits android-sources.json pins. android-import.py
took them, changing only what its comment says: the placeholders numbered as VibeOS's strings have them, and, where
the comment says "adapted", a full stop, a colon, the first letter's case or the quotation marks as VibeOS's English
has them.

